<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ka">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>NovaShop</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f7f7f7;
      color: #111;
    }

    header {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px 6%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cart {
      background: white;
      color: #111;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .shop-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 45px 0 25px;
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .products {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .product {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .product-image {
      height: 200px;
      background: #eee;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 70px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .product h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .product p {
      color: #777;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .buy {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      border: none;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      header {
        padding: 15px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">NovaShop</div>
  <div class="cart">🛒 Cart (0)</div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>აღმოაჩინე ახალი პროდუქტები</h1>
  <p>საინტერესო ნივთები ერთ ადგილზე — საუკეთესო ფასებში.</p>
  <a href="#products" class="shop-button">Shop Now</a>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title" id="products">Featured Products</h2>

<section class="products">

  <div class="product">
    <div class="product-image">⌚</div>
    <h3>Smart Watch</h3>
    <p>თანამედროვე ჭკვიანი საათი ყოველდღიური გამოყენებისთვის.</p>
    <div class="price">$29.99</div>
    <button class="buy">Add to Cart</button>
  </div>

  <div class="product">
    <div class="product-image">🎧</div>
    <h3>Wireless Headphones</h3>
    <p>უსადენო ყურსასმენები მაღალი ხარისხის ხმით.</p>
    <div class="price">$24.99</div>
    <button class="buy">Add to Cart</button>
  </div>

  <div class="product">
    <div class="product-image">💡</div>
    <h3>LED Light</h3>
    <p>მრავალფუნქციური LED განათება სახლისთვის.</p>
    <div class="price">$14.99</div>
    <button class="buy">Add to Cart</button>
  </div>

  <div class="product">
    <div class="product-image">🔌</div>
    <h3>USB Charger</h3>
    <p>სწრაფი და მოსახერხებელი USB დამტენი.</p>
    <div class="price">$12.99</div>
    <button class="buy">Add to Cart</button>
  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 NovaShop — All Rights Reserved</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
